# CFS CMS - AI Context & Instructions

This file is for AI assistants working on this project. It provides quick context for picking up work between sessions.

## Quick Context

**Project**: CFS CMS - Centralized Content Management System  
**Tech Stack**: SvelteKit + TypeScript + shadcn-svelte + Cloudflare  
**Current Phase**: Phase 1 - UI/UX First (In Progress)  
**Last Active**: December 29, 2025

