│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── components/       ← Reusable UI components
│   │   ├── services/         ← Business logic & API
│   │   ├── stores/           ← Svelte stores
│   │   ├── types/            ← TypeScript type definitions
│   │   ├── utils/            ← Utilities & helpers
