│   ├── app.html              ← HTML shell
│   └── app.d.ts              ← App type definitions
├── docs/
│   ├── DATABASE.md           ← Schema & models (TBD)
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md       ← System design (TBD)
│   ├── CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md   ← Cloudflare config (TBD)
│   └── DEVELOPMENT.md        ← Dev environment setup (TBD)
└── static/
    └── robots.txt
```

## Development Commands

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start dev server
npm run dev

# Build production
npm run build

# Preview production build
npm run preview

# Type check
npm run check

# Lint
npm run lint

# Format (if configured)
npm run format
```

